---
// Honest trust band — no fabricated badges, single warm note (card 3).
---
<section class="band band--soft" aria-labelledby="trust-h">
  <div class="band__inner">
    <div class="intro reveal">
      <h2 id="trust-h" class="h2">Real app. Real person behind it.</h2>
      <p class="lead">What you’d want to know before you tap download.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-3">
      <article class="tcard reveal">
        <div class="tcard__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8.5-8 11-4.5-2.5-8-6-8-11V5z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="tcard__title">Private by design</h3>
        <p class="tcard__body">Your data is yours — stored on Google Cloud in the UK/EU region, never sold, never used to train AI.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="tcard reveal">
        <div class="tcard__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M5.6 5.6l12.8 12.8"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="tcard__title">No ads, ever</h3>
        <p class="tcard__body">You’re the customer, not the product. Kindred makes its money from Premium, not from your attention or your data.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="tcard reveal">
        <div class="tcard__icon tcard__icon--warm" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 21s-7-4.5-9.3-9C1.2 9 2.6 5.5 6 5.5c2 0 3.3 1.2 4 2.3.7-1.1 2-2.3 4-2.3 3.4 0 4.8 3.5 3.3 6.5C19 16.5 12 21 12 21z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="tcard__title">Built and supported in the UK</h3>
        <p class="tcard__body">Independently built — not backed by ads or data resale. Email support and a real person answers.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="trust__links reveal">
      Read the full <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a> · <a href="mailto:support@kindredhome.app">support@kindredhome.app</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
